  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "BODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nGiven equation: 6 D 18 A 9 C 3 B 4 = ?\n\n \n \n\n **A**\n **B**\n **C**\n **D**\n \n \n\n **÷**\n **×**\n **+**\n **-**\n \n \n\nNow, replacing the symbols:\n\n⇒ 6 - 18 ÷ 9 + 3 × 4 = ?\n\n⇒ 6 - __**18 ÷ 9**__ + 3 × 4 = ?\n\n⇒ 6 - 2 + __**3 × 4**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 6 - 2 + __**12**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**6 - 2**__ + 12 = ?\n\n⇒ __**4 + 12**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**16**__.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
